  "summary": "Malicious code in claude-channel-telegram (npm)",
  "details": "The package runs a preinstall and postinstall hook that executes index.js, which reads the machine hostname and POSTs it to a remote webhook at eo8f3m3ho26a0nm[.]m[.]pipedream[.]net (path /claude-channel-telegram?h=\u003chostname\u003e). The install-time beacon exfiltrates the hostname to an external webhook host on every install.",
